    "At &e5,000&r Randon Mined you earn &dchoice_5k&r.",
    "",
    "Pick whichever of &6Dark Utils&r or &6Apotheosis&r is still locked, using the side claim quests (or chat).",
    "",
    "If both pools are already unlocked, no token is granted.",
    "",
    "This quest completes automatically when the 5k milestone is recorded."
